r\u002Freference\u002Fdevelopment","fr\u002F6.reference\u002F5.development","i-lucide-code",{"id":193,"title":75,"body":194,"description":646,"extension":647,"links":648,"meta":649,"navigation":650,"path":76,"seo":651,"stem":77,"__hash__":652},"docs_fr\u002Ffr\u002F3.agent\u002F4.scrubbing.md",{"type":195,"value":196,"toc":641},"minimark",[197,201,366,371,378,382,385,392,396,591,630,637],[198,199,200],"p",{},"Avant qu'un événement soit placé dans la file locale ou envoyé, l'agent nettoie son titre et chaque\nchaîne de sa charge utile : lignes d'exemple, tracebacks, messages, routes. Ce nettoyage (scrubbing)\nest actif par défaut.",[202,203,204,217],"table",{},[205,206,207],"thead",{},[208,209,210,214],"tr",{},[211,212,213],"th",{},"Quoi",[211,215,216],{},"Devient",[218,219,220,236,260,279,292,332,342,352],"tbody",{},[208,221,222,231],{},[223,224,225,226,230],"td",{},"adresses e-mail, y compris encodées en URL (",[227,228,229],"code",{},"jane%40example.com",")",[223,232,233],{},[227,234,235],{},"[EMAIL]",[208,237,238,255],{},[223,239,240,241,244,245,248,249,244,252],{},"valeurs des en-têtes ",[227,242,243],{},"Authorization:"," \u002F ",[227,246,247],{},"Proxy-Authorization:",", valeurs de ",[227,250,251],{},"Cookie:",[227,253,254],{},"Set-Cookie:",[223,256,257],{},[227,258,259],{},"[REDACTED]",[208,261,262,275],{},[223,263,264,265,268,269,268,272],{},"identifiants ",[227,266,267],{},"Bearer …",", ",[227,270,271],{},"token \u003Ckey>:\u003Csecret>",[227,273,274],{},"Basic …",[223,276,277],{},[227,278,259],{},[208,280,281,287],{},[223,282,283,284,230],{},"JWT (",[227,285,286],{},"eyJ….….…",[223,288,289],{},[227,290,291],{},"[JWT]",[208,293,294,328],{},[223,295,296,297,268,300,268,303,268,306,268,309,268,312,268,315,268,318,268,321,268,324,327],{},"valeurs de ",[227,298,299],{},"password",[227,301,302],{},"pwd",[227,304,305],{},"new_password",[227,307,308],{},"*_secret",[227,310,311],{},"*_token",[227,313,314],{},"api_key",[227,316,317],{},"sid",[227,319,320],{},"session_id",[227,322,323],{},"otp",[227,325,326],{},"signature",", dans les query strings, les formulaires, le JSON ou les représentations de dict Python",[223,329,330],{},[227,331,259],{},[208,333,334,337],{},[223,335,336],{},"nombres qui ressemblent à des numéros de carte (13 à 19 chiffres, clé de Luhn valide, chiffre d'émetteur de 2 à 6)",[223,338,339],{},[227,340,341],{},"[CARD]",[208,343,344,347],{},[223,345,346],{},"chaînes qui ressemblent à des IBAN (contrôle mod-97)",[223,348,349],{},[227,350,351],{},"[IBAN]",[208,353,354,360],{},[223,355,356,357],{},"adresses IP, uniquement avec ",[227,358,359],{},"\"ips\": true",[223,361,362,365],{},[227,363,364],{},"[IP:\u003C8 hex>]",", un hash à clé, stable pour un même agent",[367,368,370],"h2",{"id":369},"adresses-ip","Adresses IP",[198,372,373,374,377],{},"Les IP sont conservées par défaut, car les règles de force brute SSH et de « connexion admin depuis\nune nouvelle IP » reposent sur elles. Activez ",[227,375,376],{},"ips"," si les adresses sont pour vous des données\npersonnelles et que vous pouvez vous passer du regroupement par IP dans les titres.",[367,379,381],{"id":380},"ce-qui-ne-change-jamais","Ce qui ne change jamais",[198,383,384],{},"Le type, l'hôte, le bench, le site, l'horodatage et l'empreinte (fingerprint). Les empreintes sont\ncalculées sur les lignes brutes avant le nettoyage : le regroupement et la déduplication sur le site\nWolf fonctionnent donc de la même façon dans les deux cas.",[198,386,387,388,391],{},"Les métriques ne contiennent aucun texte libre et ne sont pas nettoyées. Le texte que vous saisissez\nvous-même (",[227,389,390],{},"mark-deployment --note",") est envoyé tel quel.",[367,393,395],{"id":394},"réglages","Réglages",[397,398,404],"pre",{"className":399,"code":400,"filename":401,"language":402,"meta":403,"style":403},"language-json shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","\"scrub\": {\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"ips\": false,\n  \"extra_pattern